182 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Hiring Team\054\nI designed and shipped the AI agent at Remuner\054 a chat surface where sales reps and managers ask financial questions in plain language\072 commission data\054 sales plans\054 team numbers\056 I owned the conversation design and the trust patterns\054 deciding what the agent answers\054 what it declines\054 and how it signals uncertainty\056 QuantPilot\047s job\054 translating trading logic into something a non\055technical trader trusts\054 is the same design problem at a different data layer\056\nBefore that\054 at Abacum\054 I standardised the formula syntax across an FP\046A modeling layer and designed the Dataset Manager\054 a UI layer that let finance teams configure their own data without engineering support\056 Letting a non\055technical trader configure a DCA or grid bot without engineering is the same problem\056 I also run DCA bots on Kraken myself\054 so the mechanics aren\047t new territory\056\nHappy to walk through both\072 manel\055leiva\056com\056\nBest\054\050Manel)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 181 0 R
     /Pg 176 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

